Docs.summary:
A Workspace resource in the Kore.AgentPlatform provider. Child proxy resource type under an Organization. Workspaces are not tracked (no `location`/`tags`). Lifecycle is managed through the standard ARM verbs on the child URL:
PUT .../organizations/{org}/workspaces/{workspaceName} (create or update)
DELETE .../organizations/{org}/workspaces/{workspaceName}
GET .../organizations/{org}/workspaces/{workspaceName}
GET .../organizations/{org}/workspaces (list by parent) A default Workspace is also provisioned atomically when the parent Organization is created (see `OrganizationProperties.defaultWorkspace`); additional Workspaces are managed via the operations defined here.
